{"anon_id": "D8B-029", "direction": 2, "claims": 2, "timing": 0, "total": 4, "pass": true, "reason": "已而果然，祸非倭夷乃官兵俱验；断语本身无应期，timing记0。"}
{"anon_id": "D8B-030", "direction": 2, "claims": 2, "timing": 0, "total": 4, "pass": true, "reason": "果被妇人引祸及身，变吉为凶与祸因妇人俱验；断语本身无应期，timing记0。"}
{"anon_id": "D8B-031", "direction": 2, "claims": 2, "timing": 0, "total": 4, "pass": true, "reason": "果应无事，貌凶实吉、终得无事验；断语本身无应期，timing记0。"}
{"anon_id": "D8B-032", "direction": 2, "claims": 2, "timing": 0, "total": 4, "pass": true, "reason": "雨果不止验；断语本身无应期，timing记0。"}
{"anon_id": "D8B-033", "direction": 2, "claims": 2, "timing": 2, "total": 6, "pass": true, "reason": "果于木日死，子将死与应期全中。"}
